# MIXED-CASE ON PURPOSE — these match the directory names actually on disk today.
# Master plan §10 D5 makes all-lowercase canonical and a rename is queued but NOT yet done.
# WHEN THAT RENAME HAPPENS, THE MATCHING LINE BELOW MUST BE LOWERCASED IN THE SAME CHANGE
# (PawSpace, DocCraft, and WSTERA-Link further down). These are nested independent repos;
# if an ignore line stops matching, the whole nested repo silently appears as untracked in
# this parent repo. core.ignorecase=true hides this locally on Windows — it will not hide it
# on a case-sensitive filesystem or in CI.
/products/PawSpace/
/products/DocCraft/
/products/OmniDesk/
/products/RentMatrix/
/products/money-leak-buddy/

